WEBVTT

00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:09.969
[SHRIEKS]

00:00:12.797 --> 00:00:15.061
You are fantastic!

00:00:15.104 --> 00:00:17.150
Bridget!
Compliment him back!

00:00:17.193 --> 00:00:18.499
I like your back.

00:00:18.542 --> 00:00:21.023
No! I meant say something
nice about him.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:22.720
But I do like his back.

00:00:22.764 --> 00:00:24.244
Huh?Um...

00:00:24.896 --> 00:00:26.637
Poppy, help her.

00:00:27.203 --> 00:00:28.204
Your eyes...

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:30.511
They're...

00:00:30.554 --> 00:00:32.034
Ugh... Ooh!

00:00:32.078 --> 00:00:33.731
Your ears...

00:00:33.775 --> 00:00:35.037
Your eyes...

00:00:35.081 --> 00:00:36.517
ears...Nose!

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:37.605
Skin!Neck!

00:00:37.648 --> 00:00:38.910
Skin, neck, ears, nose...

00:00:38.954 --> 00:00:40.521
face, back of your head.Are you okay?

00:00:40.564 --> 00:00:42.044
♪ Your teeth

00:00:42.088 --> 00:00:43.350
Teeth.

00:00:43.393 --> 00:00:45.526
What's going on?
Are you making fun of me?

00:00:45.569 --> 00:00:46.744
Your eyes!

00:00:47.789 --> 00:00:48.877
They're like...

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:51.358
two pools, so deep...

00:00:51.401 --> 00:00:54.926
I fear if I dive in...

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:58.060
I might never
come up for air.

00:00:58.104 --> 00:01:00.236
I might never
come up for air.

00:01:02.108 --> 00:01:03.805
And your smile...

00:01:03.848 --> 00:01:05.937
The sun itself
turns jealous...

00:01:05.981 --> 00:01:08.723
and refuses to come out
from behind the clouds...

00:01:08.766 --> 00:01:12.379
Knowing it cannot shine
half as bright.

00:01:12.422 --> 00:01:16.078
I kinda do
have a nice smile,
don't I?

00:01:16.122 --> 00:01:18.254
Yes, you do.

00:01:21.953 --> 00:01:24.391
I can't believe
I'm about to say this...

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:25.914
Guys, she's going rogue!

00:01:25.957 --> 00:01:28.917
But being here
with you today...

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:32.964
makes me realize that
true happiness is possible.

00:01:34.183 --> 00:01:35.576
Whoa.

00:01:35.619 --> 00:01:36.881
It is!

00:01:36.925 --> 00:01:40.450
True happiness
is a lot closer
than you think.

00:01:41.451 --> 00:01:44.411
It's right here.

00:01:44.454 --> 00:01:46.630
Mmm. That's pretty,
I guess.

00:01:46.674 --> 00:01:48.328
What do you think now?

00:01:48.371 --> 00:01:50.330
[GASPS]Creek?

00:01:50.373 --> 00:01:52.114
I knew he was alive!

00:01:52.158 --> 00:01:54.116
Mr. Dinkles,
he's alive!

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.683
Oh, snap!

00:01:56.162 --> 00:01:57.641
[ALL GASP]

00:01:57.685 --> 00:01:59.078
You just talked!

00:01:59.556 --> 00:02:01.123
[SQUEAKS]

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:02.342
I've been savoring
this little guy.

00:02:02.385 --> 00:02:03.865
[GASPS] Help!

00:02:03.908 --> 00:02:05.258
Uh...Mercy!

00:02:05.301 --> 00:02:06.563
Tell me, my lady,

00:02:06.607 --> 00:02:08.783
will I be seeing you
at the Trollstice feast?

00:02:08.826 --> 00:02:11.568
Well, duh.
I'll be working.

00:02:11.612 --> 00:02:12.656
It!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.616
It. Working it.
You know...

00:02:15.659 --> 00:02:17.966
workin' it.

00:02:18.009 --> 00:02:19.881
Yeah!
You're not kidding,
you will.

00:02:19.924 --> 00:02:22.144
Because you're gonna be there
as my plus one.

00:02:22.188 --> 00:02:23.232
Really?

00:02:23.276 --> 00:02:24.364
Assuming you'll say yes?

00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:25.713
Yes!Yes!

00:02:25.756 --> 00:02:27.193
Yes!

00:02:27.236 --> 00:02:29.847
Meantimes, maybe we should
find some other way to...

00:02:29.891 --> 00:02:31.501
work up an appetite.

00:02:31.545 --> 00:02:34.983
Oh, yeah?
What did you have in mind?

00:02:35.026 --> 00:02:37.377
[POP MUSIC PLAYING]

00:02:39.857 --> 00:02:40.858
[GRUNTS] Whoo!

00:02:42.338 --> 00:02:43.339
[LAUGHS]

00:02:44.079 --> 00:02:45.080
[GRUNTS]

00:02:48.344 --> 00:02:49.606
[GRUNTING] Ha-ha!

00:02:50.216 --> 00:02:51.173
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:52.348 --> 00:02:53.523
Whoo!

00:02:53.567 --> 00:02:54.611
Whoo!

00:02:55.438 --> 00:02:56.874
[TROLLS SCREAMING]

00:03:00.095 --> 00:03:01.705
Ah! Mmm.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:04.012
Whoa.

00:03:04.055 --> 00:03:06.188
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:03:06.232 --> 00:03:08.190
[YELPS] Ah...

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:09.409
[CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY]

00:03:09.452 --> 00:03:10.627
[LAUGHS]

00:03:12.238 --> 00:03:13.717
[YELPING]

00:03:13.761 --> 00:03:16.198
[POP MUSIC CONTINUES PLAYING]

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:23.771
[BOTH SIGH]

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:28.167
Your Majesty.

00:03:30.081 --> 00:03:31.735
You seem to be having...

00:03:32.432 --> 00:03:33.998
fun.

00:03:34.042 --> 00:03:35.174
Oh, I am!

00:03:35.217 --> 00:03:38.438
Meet the lovely
Lady Glittersparkles.

00:03:38.481 --> 00:03:39.482
Hmm.

00:03:42.268 --> 00:03:45.619
You remind me of someone.

00:03:45.662 --> 00:03:46.663
[SHUDDERING]

00:03:47.925 --> 00:03:50.885
She's, uh,
gonna be my plus one.

00:03:50.928 --> 00:03:52.365
Oh, I see.

00:03:52.408 --> 00:03:53.757
For a moment there
I was concerned

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:56.804
you were changing the plan.

00:03:56.847 --> 00:03:58.371
[LAUGHING][CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY]

00:03:58.414 --> 00:03:59.807
[TROLLS SHUSHING]

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:02.244
Well, this won't be
a problem at all,
Your Highness.

00:04:02.288 --> 00:04:04.551
I'll just get my worthless
scullery maid to get...

00:04:04.594 --> 00:04:06.596
another place setting ready
for the lovely...

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.947
Lady Glittersparkles.

00:04:09.991 --> 00:04:11.645
KING GRISTLE: Put her place
setting next to mine.

00:04:11.688 --> 00:04:14.082
I want her
right by my side...

00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:16.650
Hey! Lady Glittersparkles?

00:04:17.477 --> 00:04:19.392
Lady Glittersparkles!

00:04:19.435 --> 00:04:21.263
[YELPS]

00:04:21.307 --> 00:04:23.439
I'll see you at Trollstice,
yeah?

00:04:23.483 --> 00:04:24.484
[GASPS]

